%N A338614 Number of permutations p of [n] such that |p(i) - p(i-1)| <= 3 and |p(i) - p(i-2)| <= 4.
%H A338614 Alois P. Heinz, <a href="/A338614/b338614.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..3684</a>
%H A338614 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Permutation">Permutation</a>
%H A338614 <a href="/index/Rec#order_15">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (3,-2,-1,1,4,-6,-2,4,1,-1,-1,4,-3,-1,1).
%F A338614 G.f.: -(6*x^21 +4*x^20 -10*x^19 -18*x^18 -2*x^17 +27*x^16 -8*x^15 +24*x^14 -3*x^13 -23*x^12 -24*x^11 -44*x^10 +39*x^9 +46*x^8 -38*x^6 +9*x^5 +10*x^4 +3*x^3 +x^2 -2*x +1) / ((x^13 +x^12 -2*x^11 -x^10 -x^9 -2*x^8 -2*x^7 +2*x^6 +4*x^5 +x^2 +x -1)*(x -1)^2). - _Alois P. Heinz_, Nov 19 2026
%p A338614 b:= proc(s, x, y) option remember; `if`(s={}, 1, add(
%p A338614       `if`((x=0 or abs(x-j)<=4) and (y=0 or abs(y-j)<=3),
%p A338614           b(s minus {j}, y, j), 0), j=s))
%p A338614     end:
%p A338614 a:= n-> b({$1..n}, 0$2):
%p A338614 seq(a(n), n=0..20);
